{
    "name": "E2E Zoho - create custom module",
    "description": "Creates a custom module with CreateCustomModule and asserts the module metadata read back by the component. One-shot: Zoho has no API to delete a module.",
    "notes": {
        "bb04b9c4-0d24-44a5-8152-03583f32c627": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 384,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 272,
            "content": "## ⚠️ One-shot flow — manual cleanup\n\nZoho CRM has **no API to delete a custom module**, so this flow cannot clean up after itself and is **not part of the regular E2E run**.\n\n1. Before running, make sure the module **Appmixer E2E Modules** does not exist (Setup → Customization → Modules and Fields). A second run fails with `DUPLICATE_DATA`.\n2. After a green run, delete the module in the same place — custom modules are capped per edition.\n\nNeeds a paid Zoho CRM edition and an account authorized with `ZohoCRM.settings.modules.ALL` + `ZohoCRM.settings.profiles.READ` — reconnect the account in this flow. No Profile IDs are passed, so the module is opened to every profile."
        }
    },
    "flow": {
